### Invoices API Contract
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/controle_ja_api/v1
@token = replace-with-access-token
@cardId = replace-with-credit-card-id
@invoiceId = replace-with-invoice-id
@installmentId = replace-with-installment-id
@purchaseId = replace-with-purchase-id
@paymentAccountId = replace-with-payment-account-id
@paymentTransactionId = replace-with-payment-transaction-id
@month = 6
@year = 2026

### Controller summary
### InvoicesController entrega o ecossistema de faturas do cartão:
### consulta consolidada, compras adiantáveis, estorno de item/parcela,
### antecipação de parcelas futuras, pagamento e cancelamento de pagamento.

### Existing controller decisions
### - Toda rota exige Authorization Bearer token.
### - A fatura é identificada por cardId + month + year ou invoiceId.
### - Faturas pagas não podem ser editadas por operações que alterem itens, parcelas ou total.
### - Se uma compra tiver parcela paga, a compra inteira não pode ser removida/cancelada pelo fluxo de massa.
### - Alterações em parcelas precisam respeitar o escopo decidido no fluxo chamador: somente esta, desta para frente ou compra inteira.
### - Estorno registra desconto/abatimento sem apagar o histórico da parcela.
### - Antecipação move parcelas futuras da mesma compra para a fatura atual.
### - Pagamento cria transação financeira e atualiza saldo da conta pagadora e conta espelho do cartão.
### - Cancelamento de pagamento reverte os efeitos financeiros vinculados ao pagamento.
### - PUT /items/{installmentId} edita parcela/item usando OperationScope.
### - DELETE /items/{installmentId} remove parcela/item usando OperationScope.
### - DELETE /purchases/{purchaseId} cancela a compra inteira, bloqueando quando houver parcela paga.

### Common error contract
### 400 Bad Request
### {
###   "code": 400,
###   "title": "Erro | Acesso negado | Erro de Validação",
###   "message": "Mensagem de regra ou validação"
### }
###
### 404 Not Found
### {
###   "code": "404",
###   "title": "Erro",
###   "message": "Invoice not found."
### }

### Invoice details response contract
### {
###   "invoiceId": "uuid",
###   "cardId": "uuid",
###   "cardName": "string",
###   "month": "integer",
###   "year": "integer",
###   "totalAmount": "decimal",
###   "paidAmount": "decimal",
###   "openAmount": "decimal",
###   "expirationDate": "epoch milliseconds",
###   "closeDate": "epoch milliseconds",
###   "status": "string",
###   "canPay": "boolean",
###   "canAdvancePayment": "boolean",
###   "canAdvanceInstallments": "boolean",
###   "canRefund": "boolean",
###   "canEditTransactions": "boolean",
###   "canEditCard": "boolean",
###   "items": [
###     {
###       "id": "uuid",
###       "transactionId": "uuid",
###       "purchaseId": "uuid",
###       "description": "string",
###       "date": "epoch milliseconds",
###       "transactionDate": "epoch milliseconds",
###       "name": "string",
###       "categoryId": "uuid",
###       "categoryName": "string",
###       "accountId": "uuid",
###       "accountName": "string",
###       "creditCardId": "uuid",
###       "currentInstallment": "integer",
###       "totalInstallmentsPlan": "integer",
###       "type": "string",
###       "amount": "decimal",
###       "paid": "boolean",
###       "fixed": "boolean",
###       "canEdit": "boolean",
###       "itemKind": "string"
###     }
###   ]
### }

### Refund request contract
### {
###   "installmentId": "uuid obrigatório",
###   "refundAmount": "decimal obrigatório, maior que zero"
### }

### Advance request contract
### {
###   "purchaseId": "uuid obrigatório",
###   "quantityToAdvance": "integer opcional, mínimo 1 quando informado",
###   "discountAmount": "decimal opcional, não pode ser negativo"
### }

### Payment request contract
### {
###   "accountId": "uuid obrigatório; conta pagadora do usuário",
###   "amount": "decimal obrigatório, maior que zero",
###   "paymentDate": "epoch milliseconds opcional",
###   "notes": "string opcional"
### }

### Invoice item update request contract
### Usa TransactionDTO para reaproveitar o mesmo contrato de edição do lançamento.
### Campos mais usados pelo front:
### {
###   "name": "string obrigatório",
###   "description": "string opcional",
###   "type": "DESPESA | RECEITA obrigatório conforme item",
###   "amount": "decimal obrigatório",
###   "date": "epoch milliseconds obrigatório",
###   "accountId": "uuid obrigatório",
###   "categoryId": "uuid obrigatório",
###   "installments": "integer opcional; usado apenas em escopos que alteram compra",
###   "paid": "boolean",
###   "isFixed": "boolean"
### }

### OperationScope values for invoice item changes
### ONLY_THIS: altera/remove somente a parcela selecionada.
### FROM_THIS_FORWARD: altera/remove a parcela selecionada e as futuras da mesma compra.
### ALL: altera/remove a compra inteira.

### Get invoice details by card/month/year
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/card/{{cardId}}/month/{{month}}/year/{{year}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract.
### Expected 404 response when the invoice does not exist.

### List advanceable purchases for invoice period
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/card/{{cardId}}/month/{{month}}/year/{{year}}/advanceable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [
###   {
###     "purchaseId": "uuid",
###     "name": "string",
###     "maxInstallmentsAvailable": "integer",
###     "estimatedAmount": "decimal"
###   }
### ]

### Refund an invoice installment
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "installmentId": "{{installmentId}}",
  "refundAmount": 25.00
}

### Expected 200 response
### Empty body.

### Advance future installments into this invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseId": "{{purchaseId}}",
  "quantityToAdvance": 2,
  "discountAmount": 0.00
}

### Expected 200 response
### Empty body.

### Update one invoice item/installment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/items/{{installmentId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Compra ajustada",
  "description": "Opcional",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 120.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "replace-with-card-account-id",
  "categoryId": "replace-with-category-id",
  "paid": false,
  "isFixed": false
}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after recalculation.

### Update this and future invoice items/installments
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/items/{{installmentId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Compra futura ajustada",
  "type": "DESPESA",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "date": 1717100000000,
  "accountId": "replace-with-card-account-id",
  "categoryId": "replace-with-category-id",
  "paid": false,
  "isFixed": false
}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after recalculation.

### Delete one invoice item/installment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/items/{{installmentId}}?operationScope=ONLY_THIS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after recalculation.

### Delete this and future invoice items/installments
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/items/{{installmentId}}?operationScope=FROM_THIS_FORWARD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after recalculation.

### Cancel whole purchase from invoice
### Decision: if any installment of the purchase is paid or belongs to a paid/blocked invoice, returns 400.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/purchases/{{purchaseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after recalculation.

### Pay invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{paymentAccountId}}",
  "amount": 350.00,
  "paymentDate": 1717100000000,
  "notes": "Pagamento manual"
}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after payment.

### Cancel invoice payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/payments/{{paymentTransactionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Invoice details response contract after cancellation.
